pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# Output-frame paced, synchronized on free roam (title update v4). The
# offline token service (pinyon_shift_dlc_tokens, DLC-7) starts with 50
# Tokens unless the state already holds a balance started from 50: pause,
# SPONSOR CHALLENGES (seventh row), RT BUY POPULARITY SPIKE, OK on the
# explanation, the 30 minute spike for 1 Token, then the offer's "Current
# Tokens: N" and A SPEND TOKEN. The purchase is answered from the host
# balance, the title shows its success popup, and B B return to free roam.
# The runner checks the dlc.tokens.* events and the private state's
# user/pinyon_shift_tokens.toml. Run it again with the first run's .state
# directory as --state-root: the offer then shows what the first run left.
# expect-token-purchase 2 1
# expect-freeroam-return free-roam-after
cvar 2 pinyon_shift_dlc_tokens 50
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
wait 900 4000 freeroam
capture 1200 free-roam
input 1300 0010 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1306 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1420 pause
input 1460 0002 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1466 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1505 0002 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1511 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1550 0002 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1556 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1595 0002 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1601 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1640 0002 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1646 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1685 0002 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1691 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1750 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 1756 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 1970 sponsor
input 1990 0000 0 255 0 0 0 0
input 1996 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 2170 spike-explanation
input 2190 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 2196 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 2370 durations
input 2390 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 2396 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 2570 offer
input 2590 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 2596 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 2770 purchased
input 2790 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 2796 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 2950 sponsor-after
input 2970 2000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 2976 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 3130 pause-after
input 3150 2000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 3156 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
capture 3330 free-roam-after
stop 3380
